<TITLE>Shift Lever Reverse Position Warning Device</TITLE>
<LIST1 TYPE = "UNORDERED"><ITEM><PTXT>A reverse position warning buzzer is installed in the combination meter assembly; when the shift lever is moved to the R position, the intermittent sound of the buzzer informs the driver that the vehicle is in reverse.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
